{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-08_end","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-07","title":"无处可寻","storyCode":"16-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"a94d4e43ae5818f89994d9e68a7fcbb606c547ad684529fc208d0ae0965db1f6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北中心矿区</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"需要歇歇吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？不......不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果你现在还有顾虑......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们也可以自己去找。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你们带路是我自己的选择，何况我本身也确实想知道关于“奥卡”的真相，我没什么顾虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算将来追查到我，我最多也不过是被流放罢了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，前面的路应该是安全的，我没有检测到其他人的存在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"narration","text":"科谢尼娅的视线扫向Mon3tr，很快又僵硬地撇开。\n你注意到这一路来，这位研究员一直默默跟在Mon3tr的身后，时不时地打量着她，而现在连Mon3tr都察觉到了这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅，你一直在偷看我......我哪里看上去很奇怪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？不，不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是，看着你，想起了一些很久以前的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧......问题就在于，其实我也没法完全想起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些记忆太久远了，已经模糊到看不清楚，像浸了水油，字迹散成一团的纸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也许......我能问你一些问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦！虽然我也不确定自己能不能回答得上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，你叫Mon3tr，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，这是我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr......Mon3tr。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她轻轻地咀嚼着这个陌生的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr小姐，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会不会很冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说......我的意思是，你穿得很单薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你需要的话，我可以把外套脱下来给你，至少能在进入矿洞前为你遮些风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就是它可能有点旧了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦、哦！我明白了，不用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你是第一个问我这种问题的人，所以我有点没反应过来，不过我确实不冷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（对Mon3tr摇头）","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我没觉得冷，但是谢谢你的关心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你刚才是想说什么吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"（向科谢尼娅点头）","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没事。你们聊。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，科谢尼娅，你可以信任我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还要同行好一段路呢，有什么问题都可以问我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们刚才说到，你们是凯尔希所长的同伴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希所长......她现在，还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你对凯尔希很熟悉？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......或许算不上熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时我只是作为伊利亚老师的助手参与研究，能直接接触到凯尔希所长的机会并不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我只记得一些......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_graduate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅！科谢尼娅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，我在......我在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上午的实验数据为什么还没有出现在我的桌上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起老师，我这就去拿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说了多少遍，想参与进来就要跟上整个项目的节奏。如果我需要的只是一个把仪表上的数字抄到纸上的助手，我三岁的女儿也能干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有，这些稿纸上写的是什么？能量转换公式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅，我认为你应该先做好自己的本职工作，再去做一些尝试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不值得浪费您时间的东西，凯尔希所长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅毕竟还只是一个年轻的学生，熟悉实验项目还需要些时间，如果出了什么差错，责任也在我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你推导出的公式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有创意的理论模型，推演的逻辑也没有问题。假如这个公式成立的话，我们将得到一套转化率极高的供能装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这组数据似乎没有考虑到动能的折损，数据的有效性还有待验证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真要命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对......对不起，凯尔希所长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必道歉。你只是想积极地参与进来，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次汇报，你也可以来旁听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，不必那么苛责，伊利亚。年轻人的探索欲弥足珍贵，你应该适当地给予鼓励。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这个年纪，犯过比这离谱得多的错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，您说得对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢......谢谢您......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希所长......她确实曾一度点燃过我的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经和在那里的许多人一样，无比迫切地希望这项对石棺的研究，能最终指向一种全新的、普惠大众的清洁能源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此，矿工能从危险的矿区作业中解放出来，感染者能不再用生命当作燃料去驱动乌萨斯这头畸形的庞然大物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时的我是多么天真，竟从未想过......国家性格的形成也像人一样有其原因，它不是那样轻易就能被撼动或改变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，在那场事故之后，能再次听到凯尔希所长的名字，我真的很高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，至少，我能不能——能不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见到她？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"科谢尼娅，关于这件事......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！如果这个请求使你们为难，那就当我没有说过吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是以为，你们听上去、看上去，都和所长有关，你们也许会认识她，知道她的去向，或者清楚她过得好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我大概本来就没资格知道这些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会再见到凯尔希的。肯定会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这么说她确实还......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，我们都会再见到凯尔希的。博士，对不对？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......没错。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会期待的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的话，我也想去塞拉菲娜提到的，凯尔希所长创立的“罗德岛”看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请等一下......有些奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一路走过来，好像完全没有见到过任何其他人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是矿工，这里已经很接近矿井了，我们连一支纠察队、一个卫兵都没有见到过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"女大公封锁了整个矿区。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这里的人应该都被转移了？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封锁矿区我知道，但人员转移——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......这和我得知的情况不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为这里的问题只关乎“奥卡”的实验失败，可是我从来没有听说过有谁要清空整个矿区。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"的确很奇怪。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"自从我们进入矿区后，遇到的防卫力量就少得可怜。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"甚至不如布列斯克城内的防守严密。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那些消失的矿工......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"到底去了哪里？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g7_farnorthtundra"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北地区，苔原</>\n雷尔金在车厢的门板上刻下最后一笔，然后扔掉了石头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会画这个符号了，下次我帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，下次换你来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这边都整理好了，其他车厢里的东西也都搬出来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保尔他们那边已经搬完了，剩下两辆车里面本来就没什么可用的物资，我们要把机械元件拆下来带走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你说你以前在城里的机械厂干活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那拆一些吧，适配性强的、在其他机器上也能用的部件，也许能卖了换钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是......会有人愿意接手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有伤员也需要考虑在内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队伍里有太多失去行动能力的伤员，在脱离载具的条件下立刻继续上路根本不现实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要休整。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金！东西都清点好了，省着点吃预计能撑两三天吧，应该够我们走到下一个村庄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为会更多点......没什么，有粮食就已经很不错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别乔克还带人挖到了一些鼷兽囤积的坚果，顶饿，而且能放很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在比起食物，我们更缺医疗物资——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们能去哪里找？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只有移动城市，或者流动医疗点了。如果能联系上流动医疗点......"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷尔金下意识地看向Raidian。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以尝试联系附近的流动医疗点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别急着道谢，我有一个条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我感谢你和你的小队为我们提供的帮助，但我们现在的情况——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"条件是，在我尝试联系流动医疗点期间，伤员不能继续赶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为医护人员，我认为伤员需要继续休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会把他们颠来倒去的那种休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要带哪些人去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特，保尔，还有几个能从他们车间主管手里哄出子儿来的油子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你过去并不喜欢那几个洗矿厂里出来的油滑家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这与我的喜好无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不带上我？就因为我可能会反驳你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是去附近的村庄求助，不是去圣骏堡的舞会上募捐，“老爷”。你那套东西，对大字不识的农民没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再这样喊我，我会打烂你的鼻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕在那之前你的手指骨就断了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并不觉得去村庄求助是个好主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在塞拉菲娜女士联系上流动医疗点之前，我们不能就这样无所事事地待着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是伤员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们不是没有无所事事过。大伙之前还唱过歌，跳过舞——你还拉了手风琴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也说了，那是之前。现有的物资很快会用完，在那之前，我必须做些力所能及的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在我们离开的时候......我需要你留在这里，照看剩下的所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不认为这次那些村民就会向我们提供帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，感染者不是普通人开门时乐见的对象，这点我们已经从之前的经历里体会得很清楚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金进去多久了？我们是不是得去看看情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你冷静点。雷尔金让我们等消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可上次——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来吧，“小枝条”。我知道你一直跟着我们。雷尔金肯定也发现了，他只是不说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不跟尼克托他们一起留在后方呢？你奶奶也需要你照顾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶说，没关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，帮忙。所以就，来了。我能帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托知道你跟着我们来了吗？他会以为你掉队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，给他，留了......信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也行。其实我也觉得你能帮上忙，可雷尔金说什么都不愿意带上你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师......他去，做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去交涉了，看能不能从村民手里换到点粮食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，用什么......和他们换？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"载具上的零件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他明明什么也没带就过去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许他要先展示友好的态度，拿着武器或者零件铁块过去可不算是毫无威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，上次他也什么都没带，结果那些人一边和他周旋，一边派人从后门出去喊了纠察队来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得去帮他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我们也跟上去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）你给我站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金就在里面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"矿工伸出手捂住同伴的嘴，闪到一旁。\n门内传出模糊的交谈声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（金属摩擦的声音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......已经......去通知......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（撞击声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）动静听上去不对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔呜呜呜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）答应我你不会直接闯进去，我就松手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"恢复正常呼吸的一瞬间，情绪激动的矿工就将手指向了民居的后门。\n所有人都看到了雪地上那几枚向远处延伸的、清晰的脚印。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）......该死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）你们几个，随便出一个人去敲门。急迫一点，等里面的人问起就编个说辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）凭什么你不去？万一雷尔金已经被抓住，下一个不就轮到敲门的人了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我、我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）不，别乔克——"},{"type":"narration","text":"别乔克屈起手指，轻轻敲在木门上。\n从门内传来的声响几乎立刻就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）......继续敲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（敲门）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么快就回来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，你没事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特？我不是让你们在外面等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别乔克？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么在这儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，你们都是受到指示，从矿区出来找补给的矿工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，完全正确，好心的先生！我替那个鲁莽的家伙向您道歉，他没怎么离开过矿井，才分不清好人和坏人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，对不起。我们之前向其他村庄求助的时候，发生过一些不愉快的事情，我还以为这次也一样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是个实诚的孩子。至于其他村庄的人会怎么对感染者，我也清楚......不如说，乌萨斯大部分人都这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你们又不是那些不服从管理，一心只想制造混乱的感染者。你们是矿工，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然！您一定也知道，如果没有上面的大人们允许，我们走不出矿区半步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是我们的工头。上面要求他在找到补给之后，才能带我们回去复命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"要是找不到，上面的老爷是不是就不会给你们饭吃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，是的。我们这些成年人倒还好，只是像“小枝条”这样的孩子，正是经不起饿的年纪，又要怎么办呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝条”，是说这孩子？她也是矿工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......你几岁了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十、十——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"十岁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五岁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你有点怕羞，就像我女儿......如果她还活着，现在孩子都该有你这么大了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"她染上石头病之后就主动去了矿区。不过那地方不在这边，在东部，北原矿场？总之是更远的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿、矿区，很好。别......别担心，爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷......哈哈，爷爷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不知道是在什么时候，什么原因让她得了病。问她，她也不愿说。我已经很久没得到她的消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不说这个了！管理你们矿区的人应该待你们还不错，不像有些完全不管死活的，既不给人吃的，也不给他们其他的活路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"听说有些矿工为了活命，宁愿被纠察队抓去也要逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能帮助我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"在你们进来之前，我家老婆子就已经出去找其他人商量这件事啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来那脚印是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特，零件呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我这儿。给。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷尔金接过，把用衣物包裹的东西直接递给眼前的老人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是给您的。应该能把它装在收割机上，替换老化的零件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不想白白让您给出存粮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，行啊......说实话，我也不懂这些，只知道收割机确实坏了有一段时间了。如果你想帮忙，可以帮我直接把它换上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来看看吧，我以前是机械厂工人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那再好不过了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......居然真的换到了粮食，而且还不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根纳季先生说，他们村今年明明是个丰年，收割机却坏了。好不容易人工收完了苔麦，却没想到根本没有商队来，余粮也就卖不出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有现钱，大家日子都过得紧巴巴的。就算这样，他们还是愿意把东西拿出来给我们，而不是等到开春再卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特说那些零件可比苔麦值钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就我们现在的情况而言，粮食才是无价的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子......你们必须马上就回去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们完成了任务，确实应该回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想着让你们把肚子都填饱了再走呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"就算不跟我们一起，西边有些空屋，是以前村里的几户人家搬走后留下来的，你可以让大伙都去那儿，自己生火，做点吃的，暖暖身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不知道要怎么才能表达感谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。那了不起的姑娘帮我们修好了收割机，来年就能派上用场，真要说起来，我们才得感谢你们呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我们其实也没帮上什么忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"村子里，大伙过冬的储备粮多数是不能动的，虽然现在纠察队来得少了些，但税吏时不时来一趟也一样伤筋动骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"现在也就是我们几个老家伙从各户的存粮里多少掏了点出来，好给你们回去交差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"别的我们也帮不了啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许您能把您女儿的名字告诉我，我们——嗯——回到矿区之后，也许能托人帮您问问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，她不在咱们远北！她在北原，要往东边走了，可远着呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您告诉我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，反正告诉你也没什么关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫米拉娜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"暗处，一双空洞无神的眼睛觑着所有人。\n篝火噼啪，轻易掩去了他含糊的呢喃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救赎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
